TEXT 80 48 Left 3 ;#406 Current regulator diode I-V curve
TEXT 80 112 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VXZH3UE-kSw
TEXT 80 160 Left 2 ;Sweeping the voltage across two current regulator diodes shows the knee and the constant-current plateau above it.
TEXT 80 560 Left 2 ;Vm5297 and Vm5305 are zero-volt ammeters, standing in for the curve tracer's current measurement.
TEXT 80 616 Left 2 !.dc V1 0 25 0.025
TEXT 80 776 Left 2 !.include ..\..\LTspice\Models\Unverified\1N5297_illustrative.lib
